node_modules
# Keep environment variables out of version control
.env

# Written by evals/run.ts on every sweep. The scored result is uploaded as a CI
# artifact, which is where it is useful — committing it would turn a
# non-deterministic model output into a diff on every run.
evals/report.json

# `jest --coverage` output. Thousands of generated HTML files, regenerated on
# every run — the number that matters is enforced by coverageThreshold in
# jest.config.js, which needs no artifact in the tree.
coverage/
